: "005.png", "id": "1039875214854716", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_R85YrfbKdIQ7kNvwGH-5Vc&_nc_oc=AdptzbqUVAF-wIuPQYEK1z56MCWCwDZdX7dQkpOAN_gxbKmGbHaOj-JNX5fDo4jcm2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-BvC49nE92i1iteFndpuUgJH5Pxh_e6G9H0WNSRbfS6g&oe=6A3293E7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AeY5W2VL0zcQ7kNvwELRx2K&_nc_oc=Ado6-jRq5LsP7s9BKiNe1sP6oW0ZhHhFDO8PY-jS2IxWO__pwj4Efi8GxMfNvQlWEwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_GCRNdj9H9FYle8V4rnahQMnjEbqEWtWP5hHKAH5liBg&oe=6A32AF09"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope